* Simplified FAO IND 101A / 008 aft tank interior, including sump.
* Source, assumptions and calibration examples: docs/TANK.md.
* Coordinates (x,y,z) in decimetres; volume is litres.
* x from inboard wall, y along tank, z above main floor.
* Body: length 720 mm; height 844 mm; bottom widths 550/450 mm;
* top widths 850/750 mm. Sump: 100 x 150 x 75 mm,
* centred at x=150 mm, y=175 mm, open to the body at z=0.
